    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/028f4266c47c7b55f55eee8fc37088fe.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/028f4266c47c7b55f55eee8fc37088fe.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/028f4266c47c7b55f55eee8fc37088fe.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer Card Shop Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer First</strong> You are not alone. Play with friends or meet other players online. Trade cards, help each other, or compete to be the top store in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7c531a08cddafadf1c21104f12c7f06c.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7c531a08cddafadf1c21104f12c7f06c.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7c531a08cddafadf1c21104f12c7f06c.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vending Machines Across the City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place vending machines in smart spots around the city. Sell cards even when you are offline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c335f31727ab560fd85c0009c3150e85.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c335f31727ab560fd85c0009c3150e85.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c335f31727ab560fd85c0009c3150e85.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build and Manage Your Card Shop</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with booster packs. Choose the best prices and make sure customers find what they want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2bf779f8ea62b31338cb5d138ca2ceaa.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2bf779f8ea62b31338cb5d138ca2ceaa.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2bf779f8ea62b31338cb5d138ca2ceaa.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Cards</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to find exciting and powerful cards. Complete your sets or trade duplicates with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d0fd31e656d2699a2562bbf6bcc4c948.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d0fd31e656d2699a2562bbf6bcc4c948.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d0fd31e656d2699a2562bbf6bcc4c948.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Inventory Support &amp; Card Drop Rates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each card you collect becomes part of your Steam Inventory. You can view, trade, or sell cards using Steam Marketplace (if enabled). Every booster pack includes 8 cards. Here are the chances for each card rarity per slot:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common: 70% chance (about 5.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon: 20% chance (about 1.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare: 7% chance (about 0.56 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic: 2% chance (about 0.16 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary: 0.9% chance (about 0.072 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Rare: 0.1% chance (about 0.008 cards per pack)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/b054c5406da54e62e2cfbbe3412f94dc.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/b054c5406da54e62e2cfbbe3412f94dc.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/b054c5406da54e62e2cfbbe3412f94dc.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Shop System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also run an online store! Accept orders, ship products, and grow your fanbase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Store</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Decorate your space, and unlock new furniture and features. Grow your little shop into a true card empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add posters, signs, shelves, furniture\u2014make your shop look just the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/ed40b92e620e196ca92545de0a97116e.poster.avif?t=1753525620\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/ed40b92e620e196ca92545de0a97116e.webm?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/ed40b92e620e196ca92545de0a97116e.mp4?t=1753525620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
